Package: delaydistributions
Title: Compute Delay Distributions from Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", email = "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements several methodologies for computing delay distributions
    from summary statistics of previous observations. Methods include the method
    of moments, maximum likelihood estimation from summary statistics, and a
    Bayesian data synthesis approach.
